  ('7cbd7d43-c533-3aa9-a6ca-4459bf22019a', 'b3967efd-9d80-3745-839e-fa2dcd932b5d', 1, 'Hello and Goodbye', '[L1: In this lesson you learn to say hello and goodbye in English. Some greetings change with the time of day, and some are only for friends. Careful: ''Good night'' is for leaving, not for arriving.]
